<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>8.7.4: Finding the Missing Terms</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02202</md:content-id>
    <md:title>8.7.4: Finding the Missing Terms</md:title>
    <md:uuid>80683ae3-1633-476f-905a-68e00264dcb8</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><title>Cool Down Activity</title>
<para>Here are pairs of equivalent expressions in standard form and factored form. Find the missing symbols and numbers.</para>
<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para>\(x^2\; \square\; 16x \;\square \;17\) and \((x + 1)(x − 17)\)</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter the missing symbols and/or numbers.</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> − and –. The completed expression is \(x^2− 16x − 17\).</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->
<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para>\(x^2\; \square\; 16x\; \square\; 17\) and \((x − 1)(x + 17)\)</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter the missing symbols and/or numbers.</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> + and –, respectively. The completed expression is \(x^2+16x −17\).</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->
<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para>\(x^2+3x −28\) and \((x + \square)(x − \square)\)</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter the missing symbols and/or numbers.</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> 7 and 4, respectively. The completed expression is \((x + 7)(x − 4)\).</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->
<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para>\(x^2−12x −28\) and \((x \;\square \;\square)(x \;\square \;\square)\)</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter the missing symbols and/or numbers.</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> −14 and +2. The completed expression is \((x − 14)(x + 2)\).</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End --></section>
</content>
